.MARINE...
(Today through Sunday)
Issued at 904 AM PDT Tue Sep 22 2026

Fresh northwest breezes with strong gusts gradually diminish
across the southern coastal waters by Wednesday morning. Wind
driven rough seas abate to moderate for a brief period Wednesday
night into Thursday with widespread moderate northwest winds. By
Friday, winds increase with building rough seas.

